to tell you...? Or, uh, not...?

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.330
What?

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:28.910
I've... been, you know... doing gymnastics...
f-for a long time, right?

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.000
And... tomorrow? There's... a tournament...

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.080
So... like, if you want...

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.660
Sure, I guess.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.250
Rain, huh?

