00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.200
Yes, of course I'm paying attention to Minamino.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.750
After all, he accomplished the feat of
getting silver in the individual all-around

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:08.080
