and wins silver"

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.410
The young ace who will make Japan's name
ring out around the world again--

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:17.120
The young ace who will make Japan's name
ring out around the world again--

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.000
He's been gaining attention as
people put their hopes on him

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.910
to drive the Japanese gymnastics world.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:25.040
Tecchan!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:32.500
Looks like everyone's here for Minamino.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.830
How's your leg feeling?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.200
I took a painkiller earlier.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.370
I'll be fine. I can do it.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.370
You've made it this far. I'm not going
to tell you not to force yourself.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:46.870
But you don't need to strain yourself
more than necessary, either.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.000
Just do what you always do.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.450
Believe in all the work
you've put in up until now.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:56.250
Okay, let's go. It's time to head into battle!

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:02.370
Wow, so this is a gymnastics tournament?

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.620
What do you think? Amazing, right?
Are you glad you came?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.700
I-I don't know yet!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.450
Jeez... You're the one that said
you wanted to come watch.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:17.580
What you <i>really </i>want to see
is something else, right, boy?

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.580
I know it's hard to have one-way feelings.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.620
I've experienced it, too, darling.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.830
Sh-Shut up, old baldy!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.040
You're gonna get it, kid!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.040
--You little! Hey! Idiot! Apologize on your knees!
--Anyway, isn't it Mr. Joe's turn soon?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:32.910
--I'm sorry, I'll apologize
on my knees. I'm sorry!
--You little! Hey! Idiot! Apologize on your knees!
--Anyway, isn't it Mr. Joe's turn soon?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:37.910
