00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:26.910
Next, Minamino will start his floor exercise.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.160
His first tumbling pass is a double-twisting
double back tucked somersault.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.830
His landing is perfect, too!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.200
That height...

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:48.500
He must have been training his lower body
a lot to get that extra jumping power.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.080
A combination of E- and D-level skills!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.330
He landed this, as well!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.750
"Tetsuo Minamino"

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:07.620
He's got a nice, clean line
from his toes to his shoulders.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.290
He hasn't really made any mistakes so far.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:14.500
Is this the true strength
of the man who got silver?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.910
And now, his final tumbling pass--

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.700
He finishes with...

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.790
