00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.950
On the vault, Aragaki!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:39.200
The man who won the silver medal at the Olympics

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:43.330
and caused a "samurai boom"
across Japan--Jotaro Aragaki.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:48.620
In the six years since the tragedy of Lausanne,
he's had a long, hard road.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.660
He even had a retirement press
conference at once point.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.750
But he didn't end there.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:58.080
Enduring strict training,
he faced gymnastics head-on.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:03.500
And today, overturning everyone's expectations,
here in Tokyo Metropolitan Gymnasium,

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.750
Japan's Samurai has returned!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.370
This is the Yeo II!

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:38.540
A move created by the "god
of vaulting," Yeo Hong-Chul!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.200
Aragaki held on to his landing!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.660
He landed that with his own power!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.660
To stabilize his body in an instant
by moving his feet together...

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.410
This is something you can
only do with experience.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:57.910
"Vault"

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.080
"Vault"

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.080
