00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.580
I'll win tomorrow.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.500
Wait, Tecchan.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.330
Tecchan.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.580
Tetsuo!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:47.660
I noticed right away that you were off today.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:53.330
But I didn't say anything on purpose.
Do you know why?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:57.450
